\par 1.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786 \tab \tab }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786\charrsid535786 
Students will demonstrate a basic understanding of the nature of the Thermodynamic processes for pure substances and ideal gases. 
\par  
\par 2.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786 \tab \tab }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786\charrsid535786 Students will demonstrate a basic understanding of the first law of
 Thermodynamics and its applications to systems and control volumes. 
\par  
\par 3.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786 \tab \tab }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786\charrsid535786 
Students will demonstrate a basic knowledge of the second law of Thermodynamics and its applications to systems and control volumes. 
\par  
\par  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\fs22\insrsid535786\charrsid535786 Course Objective 2
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786\charrsid535786  
\par 1.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786 \tab \tab }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786\charrsid535786 Students will demo
nstrate ability to use the first law of Thermodynamics for energy conservation analysis of different Thermodynamic processes of systems and control volumes. 
\par  
\par 2.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786 \tab \tab }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786\charrsid535786 Students will demonstrate ability to use the second law of Thermodynamics for entropy balanc
e analysis of different Thermodynamic processes of systems and control volumes. 
\par  
\par 3.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786 \tab \tab }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786\charrsid535786 
Students will demonstrate ability to evaluate the thermal performance of different heat engines and refrigeration cycles through the calculation of their thermal efficiency or coefficient of performance. 
\par  
\par  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\fs22\insrsid535786\charrsid535786 Course Objective 3
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786\charrsid535786  
\par 1.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786 \tab \tab }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs22\insrsid535786\charrsid535786 
Students will demonstrate the ability to present short written reports on first and second law analyses of different Thermodynamic processes of systems and control volumes. 
\par 
